{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgffKUC367Tm51qneg5H4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"For this high-spin d⁷ ion I get **Dq ≈ 1070 cm⁻¹ (10Dq ≈ 10 700 cm⁻¹) and B ≈ 862 cm⁻¹**. I worked this out by hand rather than with the fitting tools. C is not given because the quartet bands do not depend on it.\n\n**Model**\n\nA high-spin d⁷ ion has a ⁴T₁g(F) ground state. It has three spin-allowed bands:\n- ν₁: ⁴T₁g(F) → ⁴T₂g\n- ν₂: ⁴T₁g(F) → ⁴A₂g\n- ν₃: ⁴T₁g(F) → ⁴T₁g(P)\n\nEnergies are measured from the ⁴F term. The ⁴T₂g level sits at 2Dq and the ⁴A₂g level at 12Dq. The two ⁴T₁g levels mix through the 2×2 matrix [[−8Dq + 3B, 6B], [6B, 2Dq + 12B]].\n\nLet S = √[(10Dq + 9B)² + 144B²]. Then:\n- ν₁ = 5Dq − 7.5B + S/2\n- ν₂ = 15Dq − 7.5B + S/2, so ν₂ − ν₁ = 10Dq exactly\n- ν₃ = S\n\n**Assigning the two close bands (20 160 and 21 160 cm⁻¹)**\n\n- **Option A: ⁴A₂g = 20 160 cm⁻¹.**\n  - 10Dq = 20 160 − 9 460 = 10 700, so Dq = 1070 cm⁻¹.\n  - Setting ν₁ = 9 460 gives B ≈ 862 cm⁻¹.\n  - Check: S = √[(10 700 + 7 758)² + 144·862²] ≈ 21 159 cm⁻¹, which matches the third band at 21 160 cm⁻¹.\n  - Back-calculated bands: about 9 465, 20 165 and 21 159 cm⁻¹. All are within about 5 cm⁻¹ of the data.\n- **Option B: ⁴A₂g = 21 160 cm⁻¹.**\n  - This gives Dq = 1170 cm⁻¹ and B ≈ 863 cm⁻¹.\n  - But it predicts ν₃ ≈ 22 050 cm⁻¹, while the band it would have to match is at 20 160 cm⁻¹. This option fails.\n\nSo the order is ⁴T₂g (9 460) < ⁴A₂g (20 160) < ⁴T₁g(P) (21 160 cm⁻¹). This is what Co²⁺ usually shows: the ⁴A₂g band is a weak two-electron transition that sits close to the ⁴T₁g(P) band.\n\n**Result**\n- Dq ≈ 1070 cm⁻¹\n- B ≈ 862 cm⁻¹, about 77% of the free-ion Co²⁺ value of roughly 1120 cm⁻¹.\n- C cannot be determined from these bands.\n\n{\"Dq\": 1070, \"B\": 862, \"C\": null, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Assigning 4T2g=9460, 4A2g=20160, 4T1g(P)=21160 gives 10Dq=10700 and B≈862, consistent with all three bands.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7985,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7985,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"47e2594f-5ae3-4431-98b0-3707ce050c77","uuid":"3e961572-ea56-4a14-94bd-7d85e5f460b7","timestamp":"2026-11-03T08:15:27.331Z","request_id":"req_011CgffKTrwiN5Zh3tzUwWbr"}
